{"title":"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Kim's flight took off from Newark at 10:34 AM and landed in Miami at 1:18 PM. Both cities are in the same time zone. If her flight took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> minutes, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/0/b9074389182b6bb3eb504c536a57c06d51512821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; m &lt; 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/b/3eb5079e64854a8781cd6ad26bb4b417ea9781c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h + m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/f/39f8ccfd0c4976e8e7da0e7e949e5bc0798ab247.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 46 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 47 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 50 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 53 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3dbc342d2af90f8e1044ffa0c70761eb827d531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60-34 = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> minutes between 10:34 AM and noon; and there is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes between noon and 1:18 PM. Hence the flight took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f06817759dd750d4f14160b23b063952535a927.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26 + 18 = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/3/5e3c0021b09211a469d2cb6c525243fe468a578b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+44=46$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/1021cdf265f50fe4901c8f2c5b3c5fed67cb0ec6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h+m= 46\\ \\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A\">2009 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>